<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>ServiceOps — Interface design</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,520;9..144,620&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@450;500&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #1c1915;
    --ink-soft: #4a453e;
    --muted: #6f685e;
    --line: #e4ddd2;
    --line-strong: #d4cdc1;
    --paper: #f3efe6;
    --card: #fbf9f4;
    --card-2: #f7f3eb;
    --rail: #1c1915;
    --rail-2: #2a261f;
    --rail-text: #f4efe6;
    --rail-muted: #c9c1b4;
    --copper: #8e3f1e;
    --copper-ink: #f8f1ea;
    --moss: #1f5c40;
    --moss-bg: #e5f0ea;
    --amber: #8a5a10;
    --amber-bg: #f8efd8;
    --rose: #8d2e2e;
    --rose-bg: #f8e6e3;
    --sky: #234e68;
    --sky-bg: #e5eef3;
    --shadow: none;
    --serif: "Fraunces", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, serif;
    --sans: "Outfit", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", "Cascadia Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
    --radius: 12px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
  button { cursor: pointer; }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }
  a { color: var(--copper); text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .proto {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 40;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: #11100e;
    color: #f4efe6;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2822;
  }
  .proto-mark {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9c1b4;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .proto select, .roles button {
    background: #24211c;
    color: #f4efe6;
    border: 1px solid #3a342c;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
  }
  .proto select { min-width: 220px; }
  .roles { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .roles button[aria-pressed="true"] {
    background: var(--copper);
    border-color: var(--copper);
    color: white;
  }
  .screen { display: none; }
  .screen.is-on { display: block; }
  #app.screen.is-on { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 248px 1fr; min-height: calc(100vh - 45px); }

  .auth {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 45px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
  }
  .auth-story {
    background: var(--rail);
    color: var(--rail-text);
    padding: 56px 64px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 32px;
  }
  .brand-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--rail-muted); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-family: var(--mono); }
  .mark {
    width: 22px; height: 22px; border: 1.5px solid #f4efe6; border-radius: 6px;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
  }
  .mark i { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #e7b08a; display: block; }
  .auth-story h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: 520;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .auth-story .lede { max-width: 42ch; color: var(--rail-muted); font-size: 17px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .flow { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 36px 0 0; display: grid; gap: 10px; max-width: 460px; }
  .flow li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; }
  .flow b { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 450; color: #e7b08a; font-size: 12px; }
  .auth-foot { color: var(--rail-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .auth-panel { display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 40px 24px; }
  .auth-card { width: min(420px, 100%); }
  .auth-card h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 520; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .auth-card .sub { color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 8px 0 28px; }
  label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .field { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .field input, .field textarea, .field select, .control, .search input {
    width: 100%;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 11px 12px;
    outline: none;
  }
  .field textarea { min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; }
  .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .row-between { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
    border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; padding: 10px 14px; background: transparent;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--copper); color: white; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #7a3518; }
  .btn-ghost { border-color: var(--line-strong); background: transparent; }
  .btn-ghost:hover { background: white; }
  .btn-block { width: 100%; }
  .btn:focus-visible, .roles button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #8e3f1e; outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .rail {
    background: var(--rail);
    color: var(--rail-text);
    padding: 20px 14px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 45px;
    height: calc(100vh - 45px);
  }
  .rail-brand { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; padding: 0 8px; }
  .rail-brand strong { display: block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .rail-brand span { display: block; color: var(--rail-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  nav { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  nav button {
    text-align: left;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--rail-muted);
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 9px 10px;
  }
  nav button[aria-current="page"] { background: var(--rail-2); color: var(--rail-text); }
  nav button:hover { color: var(--rail-text); }
  .who {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid #322e28;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .avatar {
    width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: #3a3028; color: #f4efe6; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
  }
  .who small { color: var(--rail-muted); display: block; }

  .workspace { min-width: 0; }
  .top {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: rgba(243, 239, 230, 0.92);
    position: sticky; top: 45px; z-index: 5;
  }
  .search { position: relative; flex: 1; max-width: 560px; }
  .search input { background: white; }
  .search-pop {
    position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: calc(100% + 6px);
    background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px;
    display: none;
  }
  .search:focus-within .search-pop { display: block; }
  .search-pop button {
    width: 100%; text-align: left; background: transparent; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
  }
  .search-pop button:hover { background: var(--card-2); }
  .top-meta { margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; }
  .live { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .live i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--moss); display: block; }
  .icon-btn {
    position: relative; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: white; border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px 10px;
  }
  .badge {
    position: absolute; top: -6px; right: -6px;
    background: var(--copper); color: white; border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 11px; min-width: 16px; height: 16px; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 0 4px;
  }
  main { padding: 28px 32px 64px; max-width: 1240px; }
  .kicker { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .page-title { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 520; font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 6px 0 8px; }
  .page-sub { color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 62ch; }
  .head-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 22px; }

  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 8px 0 22px; }
  .stat { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 14px 16px; }
  .stat span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .stat strong { display: block; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 520; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-top: 4px; }
  .stat em { font-style: normal; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; }
  .stat.warn strong { color: var(--rose); }
  .stat.good strong { color: var(--moss); }

  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.8fr; gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
  .split-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px 18px; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .stack { display: grid; gap: 10px; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
  th { text-align: left; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  td { padding: 12px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: middle; }
  tr.clickable { cursor: pointer; }
  tr.clickable:hover td { background: #f7f3eb; }
  .mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; }
  .subject { font-weight: 550; }

  .pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border-radius: 99px; padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; background: var(--card-2); }
  .pill.progress { background: var(--sky-bg); color: var(--sky); }
  .pill.open { background: var(--amber-bg); color: var(--amber); }
  .pill.pending { background: #eeeae3; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .pill.resolved { background: var(--moss-bg); color: var(--moss); }
  .pill.closed { background: #eceae6; color: var(--muted); }
  .pill.new { background: #f3e6dc; color: var(--copper); }
  .pill.critical, .sev-critical { background: var(--rose-bg); color: var(--rose); }
  .pill.high { background: #f8eadc; color: #8a3e12; }
  .pill.medium { background: var(--amber-bg); color: var(--amber); }
  .pill.low { background: var(--card-2); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .pill.breach { background: var(--rose-bg); color: var(--rose); }
  .pill.risk { background: var(--amber-bg); color: var(--amber); }
  .pill.ok { background: var(--moss-bg); color: var(--moss); }
  .pill.pause { background: #eeeae3; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .filters button, .seg button {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: transparent; border-radius: 99px; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 13px;
  }
  .filters button[aria-pressed="true"], .seg button[aria-pressed="true"], .tabs button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--ink); color: white; border-color: var(--ink); }
  tr.clickable:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--copper); outline-offset: -2px; }

  .cats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
  .cat {
    text-align: left; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px;
  }
  .cat[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--copper); background: #fbf4ee; }
  .cat strong { display: block; }
  .cat span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }

  .drop {
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-soft); background: white;
  }

  .layout-ticket { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px; gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
  .thread { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .msg { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; background: white; }
  .msg header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
  .msg.internal { background: #f8f1e4; border-color: #eadcc4; }
  .composer { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .meta-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .meta-list div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; font-size: 13px; }
  .meta-list dt { color: var(--muted); }
  .sla-track { height: 6px; background: #e7e1d6; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; margin: 8px 0; }
  .sla-track span { display: block; height: 100%; width: 72%; background: var(--moss); }
  .sla-track.risk span { width: 88%; background: var(--amber); }
  .sla-track.breach span { width: 100%; background: var(--rose); }
  .timeline { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .timeline li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 12px 1fr; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; }
  .timeline i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--copper); margin-top: 6px; }

  .lane h3 { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
  .lane h3 span { font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .tcard { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px; background: white; text-align: left; width: 100%; }
  .tcard + .tcard { margin-top: 8px; }
  .tcard:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); }

  .bars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr); gap: 8px; align-items: end; height: 160px; }
  .bar-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; gap: 4px; height: 100%; }
  .pair { display: flex; gap: 3px; align-items: flex-end; height: 130px; }
  .pair i { display: block; width: 8px; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; }
  .pair .o { background: #1c1915; }
  .pair .r { background: #c47a52; }
  .bar-col em { font-style: normal; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); }
  .legend { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 8px; }
  .legend b { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-right: 6px; }
  .load { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .load div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr 24px; gap: 8px; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; }
  .track { height: 8px; background: #ece7de; border-radius: 99px; }
  .track span { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--ink); border-radius: 99px; }

  .policy { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: center; }
  .note {
    background: #f8f1e4; border: 1px solid #eadcc4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; color: #5c4528; font-size: 13px;
  }
  .banner {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; align-items: center;
    background: var(--moss-bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .denied { max-width: 520px; padding-top: 40px; }
  .article { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .inbox-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px 1fr auto; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: start; }
  .inbox-item .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--copper); margin-top: 6px; }
  .inbox-item.read .dot { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    #app.screen.is-on { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .rail { position: relative; top: 0; height: auto; }
    .auth { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .auth-story { padding: 32px 24px; }
    .auth-story h1 { font-size: 40px; }
    .stats, .cats, .split, .split-3, .layout-ticket { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    main { padding: 20px 16px 48px; }
    .top { padding: 12px 16px; }
    .proto { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body data-role="employee" data-screen="login">
  <div class="proto">
    <div class="proto-mark">Design prototype</div>
    <label class="sr" for="screen-jump" style="position:absolute;left:-999px">Screen</label>
    <select id="screen-jump" aria-label="Jump to screen"></select>
    <div class="roles" role="group" aria-label="Preview as">
      <button type="button" data-role="employee" aria-pressed="true">Employee</button>
      <button type="button" data-role="agent" aria-pressed="false">Agent</button>
      <button type="button" data-role="manager" aria-pressed="false">Manager</button>
      <button type="button" data-role="admin" aria-pressed="false">Administrator</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="login" class="screen is-on" data-screen="login">
    <div class="auth">
      <div class="auth-story">
        <div>
          <div class="brand-row"><span class="mark"><i></i></span> ServiceOps</div>
          <h1>One desk for every request, incident, and deadline.</h1>
          <p class="lede">Employees ask for help in one place. The IT team assigns, investigates, and closes the work without losing the history.</p>
          <ol class="flow">
            <li><b>01</b><span>Submit a request with the category, urgency, and anything the agent will need.</span></li>
            <li><b>02</b><span>A manager or rule gives the ticket an owner. The SLA clock starts with the policy that applied at that moment.</span></li>
            <li><b>03</b><span>The agent investigates, writes to the employee, and keeps internal notes off the public thread.</span></li>
            <li><b>04</b><span>Resolution is recorded. The employee confirms, and the ticket closes.</span></li>
            <li><b>05</b><span>Deadlines, breaches, and privileged changes stay on the record.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div class="auth-foot">Northwind Internal IT · Colombo · Thursday 5 November 2026</div>
      </div>
      <div class="auth-panel">
        <form class="auth-card" id="signin-form">
          <h2>Sign in</h2>
          <p class="sub">Use your work email. New accounts receive the Employee role.</p>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Work email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" value="amina.perera@northwind.example" required />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="password">Password</label>
            <input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" value="••••••••" required />
          </div>
          <div class="row-between" style="margin-bottom:16px">
            <span class="hint" style="margin:0">Session stays on this browser until you sign out.</span>
            <button type="button" class="btn" id="goto-reset" style="padding:0;color:var(--copper)">Forgot password</button>
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit">Sign in</button>
          <p class="hint">The role control above chooses which desk this preview opens. It is not part of the product form.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="reset" class="screen" data-screen="reset">
    <div class="auth">
      <div class="auth-story">
        <div>
          <div class="brand-row"><span class="mark"><i></i></span> ServiceOps</div>
          <h1>Reset access without exposing the account.</h1>
          <p class="lede">If the email matches an active account, a single-use link is sent. The screen does not say whether the address exists.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="auth-foot">Links expire after 30 minutes and can be used once.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="auth-panel">
        <form class="auth-card" id="reset-form">
          <h2>Forgot password</h2>
          <p class="sub">We will email a reset link if an active account uses this address.</p>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="reset-email">Work email</label>
            <input id="reset-email" type="email" required placeholder="name@northwind.example" />
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit">Send reset link</button>
          <p id="reset-done" class="hint" hidden>If an account exists for that email, a reset link is on its way.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:16px"><button type="button" class="btn" id="back-login" style="padding:0;color:var(--copper)">Back to sign in</button></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="app" class="screen" data-screen="app">
    <aside class="rail">
      <div class="rail-brand">
        <span class="mark"><i></i></span>
        <div><strong>ServiceOps</strong><span>Northwind Internal IT</span></div>
      </div>
      <nav id="nav" aria-label="Primary"></nav>
      <div class="who">
        <div class="avatar" id="avatar">AP</div>
        <div><strong id="who-name">Amina Perera</strong><small id="who-role">Employee · Finance</small></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="workspace">
      <header class="top">
        <div class="search">
          <label class="sr" for="q" style="position:absolute;left:-999px">Search</label>
          <input id="q" placeholder="Search tickets, incidents, people" />
